  <p class="lede">Author of cinematic science fiction and Norse-flavored urban fantasy. Crafted Stories. <span class="amp">&amp;</span> Forged Software.</p>
  <div class="essay">
    <p>Riley E. Antrobus crafts adrenaline-fueled space adventures and myth-infused urban fantasies — stories where resilience, quick wit, and a healthy dose of chaos shape every journey. From the snark-filled <a href="/books/warborn-protocols/">Warborn Protocols</a> series to the Norse-inspired <a href="/books/echoes-of-yggdrasil/">Echoes of Yggdrasil</a> saga, Riley weaves cinematic action, sharp humor, and ancient mysteries into universes where underdogs, hidden powers, and impossible odds collide.</p>
    <p>Beyond the page, Riley builds small, sharp software under the <a href="/about/ink-iron-apps.html">Ink &amp; Iron Apps</a> banner — proof that "Crafted Stories. Forged Software." is more than a tagline. When not conjuring interstellar mayhem or untangling ancient legends, Riley can be found buried in classic sci-fi and fantasy novels, building intricate spreadsheets for fun, or gazing up at the Colorado night sky in search of the next idea.</p>
    <p class="pull">"Crafted stories. Forged software."</p>
    <p>Find every book in <a href="/books/">the library</a>, or read about the software side at <a href="/about/ink-iron-apps.html">About Ink &amp; Iron Apps</a>.</p>
